             0[Cumulative Amount],\r\n                       GetDiff.dDiff [Delay in Payment]\r\n                        ,CASE WHEN GetDiff.dDiff <= 0 THEN ParentRef.mAmount ELSE 0 END[UnDue Amount]\r\n                         ,CASE WHEN GetDiff.dDiff > 0 AND \r\n                        GetDiff.dDiff <= {num2} THEN ParentRef.mAmount ELSE 0 END[0-{num2} Days]";
